00:15:01.133 --> 00:15:02.400
Oh my God.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.635
- Burt Reynolds, do you
remember Burt Reynolds?

00:15:03.635 --> 00:15:05.337
- Oh yeah, he'd go on
with Dom, and yeah.

00:15:05.337 --> 00:15:06.672
- Yeah, yeah, no, it was great.

00:15:06.672 --> 00:15:09.808 align:start size:84% position:16%
And so I think I
feel like the people

00:15:09.808 --> 00:15:12.478
