00:17:15.166 --> 00:17:17.369
- For ESG, yeah, yeah.

00:17:17.369 --> 00:17:19.837
It had nothing to do
with the consumer.

00:17:19.837 --> 00:17:22.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so it meant let's
make fun of the consumer.

00:17:22.707 --> 00:17:25.077 align:start size:97% position:3%
And so the consumer's going,
"Why is this happening?"

00:17:25.077 --> 00:17:26.478 align:start size:84% position:16%
They get educated, and
they're going like,

00:17:26.478 --> 00:17:27.912
"Well, screw them.

00:17:27.912 --> 00:17:29.548 align:start size:97% position:3%
There's a shit load of
beer out there I can drink.

00:17:29.548 --> 00:17:31.250
It doesn't have
to be Bud Light."

00:17:32.117 --> 00:17:33.351
- What do you make?

00:17:33.351 --> 00:17:34.019 align:start size:81% position:19%
- So you can have,
like, go ahead.

00:17:34.019 --> 00:17:34.953
- No, no, no.

00:17:34.953 --> 00:17:35.621
No, you go, you're the guest.

00:17:35.621 --> 00:17:36.822
Continue.

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:39.223
- I already forgot
what I was gonna say.

00:17:39.223 --> 00:17:42.060 align:start size:97% position:3%
- You were really gonna bring
home the Bud Light point.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.729
I think you were gonna
connect it to Target.

00:17:43.729 --> 00:17:46.131 align:start size:88% position:13%
- I know, here's the
thing, here's the thing.

00:17:46.131 --> 00:17:49.967
I don't believe that
boycotts are good.

00:17:49.967 --> 00:17:54.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
However, I think that
when you see that somebody

00:17:54.772 --> 00:17:57.476
is trying to pull
a fast one on you,

00:17:57.476 --> 00:18:02.247 align:start size:97% position:3%
that's worthy enough to call
it out and to avoid them.

00:18:02.247 --> 00:18:04.216
And then when you see somebody

00:18:04.216 --> 00:18:06.418
who's being unfairly targeted,

00:18:06.418 --> 00:18:08.587
that is when you share the risk,

00:18:08.587 --> 00:18:10.322
and that is when
you go like, okay,

00:18:10.322 --> 00:18:12.791
I'm gonna go buy
Greg Gutfeld's book

00:18:12.791 --> 00:18:16.995
because they accused him of
being a bigot or a racist,

00:18:16.995 --> 00:18:18.697
because I know he isn't.

00:18:18.697 --> 00:18:21.133
I want to have the
Jason Aldean effect,

00:18:21.133 --> 00:18:23.836
where it's like, oh,
so you said a song

00:18:23.836 --> 00:18:25.837
that has no Black people in it,

00:18:25.837 --> 00:18:29.241
that has no lynching
narratives, is racist.

00:18:29.241 --> 00:18:31.577
Okay, you're trying to
destroy this person?

00:18:31.577 --> 00:18:33.678
I'm gonna make this
song number one.

00:18:33.678 --> 00:18:37.616 align:start size:97% position:3%
- What's your policy on when
you're watching the clips

00:18:37.616 --> 00:18:40.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the lunatics of "The
View", or the crazy people

00:18:40.852 --> 00:18:43.322
at the televised mental
institution of MSNBC,

00:18:43.322 --> 00:18:44.523
when you're prepping your show,

00:18:44.523 --> 00:18:45.724
because I have no doubt
you're going through

00:18:45.724 --> 00:18:47.158 align:start size:81% position:19%
the same thing
I'm going through.

00:18:47.158 --> 00:18:49.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
On one hand, I want these
people to be ignored

00:18:49.027 --> 00:18:50.995
and disappear and whatever.

00:18:50.995 --> 00:18:53.798
On the other hand, they are
literally writing our shows

00:18:53.798 --> 00:18:56.101
for us, and I do think
they have to be exposed.

00:18:56.101 --> 00:18:58.470
But I always have this
little internal struggle

00:18:58.470 --> 00:18:59.838
with how much attention.

00:18:59.838 --> 00:19:01.072
- I know, I know.

00:19:01.072 --> 00:19:02.574
- So what do we do
with that, Greg?

00:19:02.574 --> 00:19:03.642
- Do you know what it is?

00:19:03.642 --> 00:19:04.943
- We monetize it, I guess.

00:19:04.943 --> 00:19:08.280
- It's like you have to
take a tolerance break.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:12.484
Do you know, when like people
smoke, let's say, the herb,

00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:17.456 align:start size:97% position:3%
and you realize your tolerance
level's gotten so high,

00:19:17.456 --> 00:19:22.528 align:start size:97% position:3%
you need to take a tolerance
break from gotcha videos.

00:19:23.328 --> 00:19:25.864
When I look at "The View" clips,

00:19:25.864 --> 00:19:29.000 align:start size:88% position:13%
if there is a punchline
for me exiting it,

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.268
then I've gotta use it.

00:19:30.268 --> 00:19:32.771
Because everybody
loves those clips,

00:19:32.771 --> 00:19:36.775 align:start size:97% position:3%
and if you have a good zinger,
boom, you put that in there

00:19:36.775 --> 00:19:38.042
and that's fun.

00:19:38.042 --> 00:19:39.210
A lot of people do it
themselves on Twitter.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:40.745 align:start size:88% position:13%
You know, they'll
tweet something and go,

00:19:40.745 --> 00:19:42.380
